  "method": "ConfigLoader directly reads finite scalar cases in separate explicit files within one Ruby process. The raw JSON batch, exit, runtime and full ordinary CLI JSON are retained. CLI comparisons use all files/summary fields and omit engine metadata. Each config and source is checked unchanged. No show-cops renderer dependency.",
  "normalization": "Only untagged plain exponential values accepted by the existing f64 reader but rejected as Float by Psych due to missing dot/exponent-sign are quoted as String. Quoted and explicit tags are left to their existing paths. No broad numeric fuzz or date-type expansion.",
